Package: HallOdiGly
Title: HallO-diGly — diGly Occupancy Analysis Shiny App
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-09-02
Description: >
  Modular interactive Shiny application for label-free diGly (ubiquitin
  remnant) ubiquitinomics analysis using DIA-NN parquet output and the
  limpa framework. Designed for any biological system, cell line set, or
  experimental design — not hard-coded to PDAC or any specific samples.
  The pipeline covers: DIA-NN parquet scanning and run annotation,
  GG-site identification filters, precursor missingness filtering,
  FASTA-based site mapping, DPC estimation, median normalisation,
  DPC-Quant (site and protein levels), PCA / PLS-DA QC, occupancy
  correction (site minus protein log2 abundance), reproducibility
  filtering and site tiering, differential expression with limma/limpa
  at three layers (site, occupancy, protein), PhosphoSitePlus annotation
  of ubiquitination sites, integration with a total-proteome DE table to
  separate degradative from non-degradative ubiquitination events, and
  multi-format export (TSV, RDS, SVG).
Depends:
  R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
